51441</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000569-Gower1"><label>4</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gower</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name><name><surname>Nagy</surname><given-names>TR</given-names></name><name><surname>Goran</surname><given-names>MI</given-names></name></person-group><year>1999</year><article-title>Visceral fat, insulin sensitivity, and lipids in prepubertal children.</article-title><source>Diabetes.</source><volume>48(8)</volume><fpage>1515</fpage><lpage>1521</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10426367</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000569-Goran1"><label>5</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Goran</surname><given-names>MI</given-names></name><name><surname>Bergman</surname><given-names>RN</given-names></name><name><surname>Cruz</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Watanabe</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Insulin resistance and associated compensatory responses in African-American and Hispanic children.</article-title><source>Diabetes Care.</source><volume>25(12)</volume><fpage>2184</fpage><lpage>2190</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12453958</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000569-US1"><label>6</label><citation citation-type="book"><collab>US Census Bureau</collab><article-title>2004 U.S. Interim Projections by age, sex race, and Hispanic Origin.</article-title><comment><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.census.gov/ipc/www/usinterimproj,internet">http://www.census.gov/ipc/www/usinterimproj,internet</ext-link> release 2004</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000569-Shulman1"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shulman</surname><given-names>GI</given-names></name></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>Cellular Mechani